<title>UK: TR Prop, Edge sell UK property.</title>
<headline>TR Prop, Edge sell UK property.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's TR Property Investment Trust Plc said on Monday that along with joint owners Edge Properties Plc it had sold a property to Cornhill Insurance for 8.1 million stg.</p>
<p>The sale of the property, acquired in 1996 for 5.7 million stg, reflected an initial yield of 6.3 percent.</p>
<p>The Cardiff-based property, comprising two units let to DIY group Wickes and clothing retailer Matalan.</p>
<p>Edge said it had made a profit of about 800,000 stg on its initial investment of 650,000 stg in the joint venture.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
